als to see and cure. You help the animals and not hurt them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/f59f42d5dc763978805bee709ba55631.avif?t=1743625611\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/7b6ce1976a3d07945c1202386a919fbc.poster.avif?t=1743625611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/7b6ce1976a3d07945c1202386a919fbc.webm?t=1743625611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/7b6ce1976a3d07945c1202386a919fbc.mp4?t=1743625611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Overcome the Mad Scientists enemies and obstacles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/72a483c0f1a766984c402b9361e34264.poster.avif?t=1743625611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/72a483c0f1a766984c402b9361e34264.webm?t=1743625611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/72a483c0f1a766984c402b9361e34264.mp4?t=1743625611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/6f6e49872b5f4830ba6529a66ad1e255.avif?t=1743625611\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478640/extras/19ca652bd69f3a3daa3fe80597d084f1.poster.avif?t=1743625611\" ><source src=\"https://sha